// D47: a guard that couples two integer variables (`amount + credit`) is outside the fragment
// where threshold witnesses cover every case. The witnesses around 100 and 1000000 never
// pair `amount = 1000001` with `credit = -1000001`, which passes the guard and breaks the
// invariant. `charter verify --backend thresholds` must say INCONCLUSIVE (exit 3), not ok.
Fact actor_t Identified by Eve.
Fact amount Identified by Int.
Placeholder credit For amount.
Fact moved Identified by amount.

Act move Actor actor_t Related to amount, credit
  Holds when amount + credit < 100
  Valid when amount + credit < 100
  Creates moved(amount).

Invariant moved-stays-small
  When !(Exists moved: moved.amount > 1000000).
